cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: "docxplus — the Intelligent Document Container"
abstract: >-
  A standards-first reference implementation of DOCX and ODT containers carrying
  modular, signed and payload-encrypted intelligence layers through package
  extension points, with an optional steganographer media backend. Structural
  validation is not full standards certification; authenticity requires a pinned key.
authors:
